<!-- ========== SUB HERO ========== -->
<section class="sub-hero">
  <div class="sub-hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">— About ZenX</div>
    <h1>A BVI-anchored issuer, <em>built for institutional RWA</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lead">ZenX exists to fill a single, structural gap in the on-chain RWA stack: a real issuer, with real legal personality, bearing a real redemption obligation against every token it puts into circulation.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== CONTENT ========== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="content-block">
    <h2>Why ZenX exists</h2>
    <p class="lead">The institutional RWA market does not need another "tokenization platform." It needs an issuer.</p>
    <p>For the past several years, the on-chain RWA conversation has been dominated by platforms that mint tokens but avoid the hard part: holding the underlying, committing to redeem, and standing behind the obligation in a recognizable legal form. The result is a market where most "RWA tokens" are, in legal substance, unsecured IOUs from anonymous teams — and institutional allocators can see it.</p>
    <p>ZenX was built to be the part the market was missing. We are an issuer first — a BVI-incorporated entity that issues tokens on behalf of partner platforms, anchors them 1:1 to segregated qualified-custody assets, and undertakes a hard redemption obligation set out in a whitepaper and a token purchase agreement.</p>
    <p>We are not a protocol. We are not a yield product. We are the institution that stands between a token and the asset it represents.</p>

    <div class="quote-block">
      <p>"Patient capital doesn't ask who built the protocol. It asks who is on the hook when something goes wrong."</p>
      <cite>— ZenX Founding Principle</cite>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== THREE PILLARS (Re-stated) ========== -->
<section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-card);">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">— Our Three Actions</div>
      <h2>Issuance. Anchoring. <em>Undertaking.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">These three actions are not features of a platform. They are the legal and operational substance of what ZenX is. Each is delivered independently, to every partner, on every token.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pillars">
    <div class="pillar reveal">
      <div class="pillar-num">01</div>
      <h3>Issuance</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">We design, deploy, and administer the tokens that represent our partners' assets. The issuer of record is ZenX Limited.</p>
      <ul class="pillar-features">
        <li>Token architecture &amp; contract design</li>
        <li>Multi-chain deployment (BSC, ETH, custom)</li>
        <li>Multi-sig + timelock admin controls</li>
        <li>Third-party audit coordination</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal">
      <div class="pillar-num">02</div>
      <h3>Anchoring</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">Each issued token corresponds to a quantity of a specified underlying asset. We acquire and hold that asset, for our own account, before completing any redemption.</p>
      <ul class="pillar-features">
        <li>1:1 underlying asset reserves</li>
        <li>Independent qualified-custodian holding</li>
        <li>Full segregation from ZenX corporate assets</li>
        <li>Periodic third-party attestation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar reveal">
      <div class="pillar-num">03</div>
      <h3>Undertaking</h3>
      <p class="pillar-desc">We undertake, in a whitepaper and a contractual agreement, to redeem every validly surrendered token for the corresponding underlying asset. This is the issuer's ultimate commitment.</p>
      <ul class="pillar-features">
        <li>Whitepaper-level hard undertaking</li>
        <li>Standard settlement: T+1 to T+2</li>
        <li>Exceptional manual channel for edge cases</li>
        <li>Enforceable under BVI law</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== RealFinance FLAGSHIP ========== -->
<section class="case-section" style="padding-bottom: 96px;">
  <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">— Flagship Partnership</div>
      <h2>Powering <em>RealFinance</em>'s RWA suite.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">RealFinance is our flagship partner — an institutional RWA yield and liquidity platform. We issue rFUIDL and rsFUIDL on RealFinance's behalf, and provide the full underlying-asset anchoring stack behind them.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="case-card reveal">
    <div class="case-left">
      <div class="case-tag">Flagship Partner</div>
      <div class="case-partner-name">RealFinance</div>
      <div class="case-partner-sub">Institutional RWA Yield &amp; Liquidity Hub</div>
      <div class="case-quote">"RealFinance provides the front door. ZenX is the back office that makes the door credible."</div>
    </div>
    <div class="case-right">
      <h3 class="case-right-title">rFUIDL &amp; rsFUIDL: end-to-end issuance, anchoring, and redemption.</h3>
      <p class="case-right-body">For RealFinance's flagship RWA products, ZenX serves as the issuer of record, designs the on-chain token architecture, coordinates the underlying FUIDL reserves with qualified custodians, and bears the 1:1 redemption obligation that the products are marketed against.</p>
      <div class="case-stats">
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="num">rFUIDL</div>
          <div class="label">Base Token</div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="num">rsFUIDL</div>
          <div class="label">Staking Certificate</div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="num">BSC</div>
          <div class="label">Primary Chain</div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <div class="num">1:1</div>
          <div class="label">FUIDL Anchor</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://realfinance.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="case-link">Visit RealFinance</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== ENTITY SNAPSHOT ========== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="content-block">
    <h2>The entity behind the tokens</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li><strong>Legal Name</strong><span>ZenX Limited</span></li>
      <li><strong>Jurisdiction</strong><span>British Virgin Islands (BVI)</span></li>
      <li><strong>Entity Type</strong><span>BVI Business Company</span></li>
      <li><strong>Regulatory Status</strong><span>Subject to BVI Business Company Act and BVI AML Regulations</span></li>
      <li><strong>Role</strong><span>Issuer and underlying-asset anchor for ZenX Tokens, including rFUIDL and rsFUIDL</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-32">For a full overview of our compliance and governance framework, see <a href="compliance.html" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);">Compliance &amp; Governance</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

